# with each release.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PlanetTools.jl"
abstract: "Julia package for helper functions that can be applied in Julia scripts for data processing and plotting of output from simulations with planetary models. It has been developed with focus on simulations done with NASA GISS's ModelE and its exoplanet version, ROCKE-3D, but its usefulness is not necessarily confined to this. The collection of tools includes reading and writing NetCDF output, deriving new variables, area-weighted and temporal statistics, trends and their significance, ensemble statistics, aerosol and dust size distributions, and plotting of fields with missing data."
authors:
